        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_4393b0fcfe4f4e0ea7dd76dec15b39dd",
      "statement": "Nothing in the Boundary root Containerfile (which builds the unrelated SRE-tools investigation image, not Trusted Actions) or in internal/cmd (the rosa-boundary CLI's command package) currently invokes the Trusted Actions HTTP API or an rta client; the architectural edge from the investigation container to Trusted Actions is not yet wired into the rosa-boundary CLI's own code, though an SRE can still reach Trusted Actions manually via the standalone rta CLI.",
