      "statement": "cmd/action-cli bypasses the Trusted Actions HTTP server entirely: it drives the same authorization, audit-logging, Backplane-client, and action-execution pipeline directly against a kubeconfig, letting a developer verify an action's end-to-end behavior without a running deployment, whereas cmd/test-client and the rta CLI both exercise a running server over HTTP.",
